        "indicative scenario figures, not a farmer-specific budget and not a forecast",
        "assembled by the project on 2026-09-10 and not reviewed by an agronomist",
        "cost basis is cash cost and excludes imputed family labour and land rent",
        "resampled as paired rows, so results are reported as a p10 to p90 band and every estimate built from them carries basis \"scenario\"",
